<view class="container"><view class="eyebrow">STAY IN THE LOOP</view><view class="row"><view class="title">校园新鲜事</view><text class="badge warn" wx:if="{{mode === 'demo'}}">示例通知</text></view><view class="subtitle">学校与学院的消息，在这里汇聚。</view>
<view class="card"><picker range="{{sources}}" value="{{sourceIndex}}" bindchange="source"><view class="picker">{{sources[sourceIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><view class="row" style="margin-top:20rpx"><input style="flex:1;min-width:0" placeholder="搜索标题或发布单位" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="keyword" bindconfirm="query"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="query" loading="{{busy}}">搜索</button></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{hint}}" class="hint warning">{{hint}}</view><view class="notice card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="detail" data-i="{{index}}"><view class="muted">{{item.dept || sources[sourceIndex]}} · {{item.time}}</view><view class="notice-title">{{item.title}}</view><text class="link">查看通知 ↗</text></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!items.length}}">{{busy ? '正在加载通知…' : '暂无相关通知'}}</view><view class="hint">当前查询来源的第一页，按标题与发布单位筛选。部分站点需要服务器具备校园网或 VPN 访问能力。</view></view>
